     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Language of obligation",
     "texto": [
      "**Må** introduces an obligation; **bør**, a recommendation. **Så langt det er mulig** limits the scope of the rule. Identify the textual exception and don't invent an authorisation. For a binding interpretation, consult the responsible person or body."
     ],
